## Scene 4: The Spilled Coffee Phenomenon
**Focus:** The Messy Reality of Genius  
**Estimated Duration:** 1:25 - 2:00 (35s)

| Element | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Visuals** | Macro shot of a coffee stain spreading on a napkin; text appearing within the stain. Montage of messy desks (ink, crumpled paper, stained napkins). Trembling hand with a quill. |
| **Audio** | Somber, investigative tone. Low, rhythmic heartbeat percussion. |
| **Narration Key Points** | Genius isn't a clean lightning bolt; it's born from the chaos of spilled cups and frantic, unpolished debate. |
| **Pacing** | Intense, slightly faster, more rhythmic/percussive. |

