## Scene 5: The Philosophical Takeaway
**Focus:** The Legacy / Conclusion  
**Estimated Duration:** 2:00 - 2:25 (25s)

| Element | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Visuals** | Slow zoom out from a modern cup to a vast, glowing city skyline at night. Fade to black. Beyond3Baje Logo. |
| **Audio** | Cinematic crescendo, dropping suddenly to a single, sustained piano note. Final low cello fade. |
| **Narration Key Points** | We live in a world built on the arguments of ghosts. To see truth, look at the stains left behind. |
| **Pacing** | Grand, expansive, then sudden silence for impact. |